	Man, this hacked me off!  I was meandering around the
Gnomish mines with one of the most promising Samurai I've had in a long
time, when 
		A small dart shoots out at you! 
		The dart was poisoned!
		The poison was fatal!
		You die...
	Seriously, if you need an AoLS to survive something, that
something should not be part of the game.  (unless caused by gross
stupidity, etc, which this was not)  I was not slowed by weight or
anything, so I didn't miss a turn I normally might have had.  No, I did
not have poison resistance; most of my chars aren't so blessed until
later, assuming they survive that long.
	Of course, I could have survived if I had searched 11 or so
turns before each move, but let's get real.

